---
/*
 * Maintenance notice for the California app.
 *
 * Nothing on this site links here. During an upgrade window a Cloudflare
 * redirect rule sends california.opuspopuli.org/* to this page, so every way
 * into the app (bookmarks, search results, the installed app) lands here, not
 * only the header's sign-in button. Deleting the rule reopens the app; this
 * page can stay deployed between windows.
 *
 * The app is bilingual (English/Spanish) and the people redirected here are
 * its users, so the notice is given in both. The Spanish block carries
 * lang="es" so screen readers switch pronunciation.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';

const contactEmail = 'hello@opuspopuli.org';
const linkClass = 'text-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Down for maintenance"
  description="Opus Populi California is briefly offline while we upgrade it."
  noindex
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Opus Populi California"
    title="We're upgrading"
    titleEm="California."
    subtitle="The California app is briefly offline while we install a major update. Your account and saved information are safe, and there's nothing you need to do."
  />

  <Section>
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 max-w-4xl">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 tracking-tight">What's happening</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-ink/80">
          <p>
            We're bringing the app up to date with several months of work, including
            bill summaries on request and more complete campaign finance records. We
            closed it during the upgrade so nobody sees a half-finished page.
          </p>
          <p>
            Please check back soon. If you have a question in the meantime,
            write to us at <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class={linkClass}>{contactEmail}</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div lang="es">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 tracking-tight">En mantenimiento</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-ink/80">
          <p>
            La aplicación de California está temporalmente fuera de línea mientras
            instalamos una actualización importante. Su cuenta y su información
            guardada están seguras; no tiene que hacer nada.
          </p>
          <p>
            Vuelva a visitarnos pronto. Si tiene alguna pregunta, escríbanos a
            <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class={linkClass}>{contactEmail}</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-14">
      <a href="/" class={linkClass}>Return to opuspopuli.org</a>
    </p>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
